exports[`hides unpublished builds and renders selectable commands in all supported languages > en 1`] = `"<aside class="preview-install"><h3>Install Marea for students</h3><p>Copy the command for the student&#x27;s system. It includes this server&#x27;s version and address.</p><p>Marea 0.1.0-preview.1 · <a href="https://github.com/school/marea/releases" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Preview versions</a></p><label>macOS / Linux<textarea readOnly="" rows="3">curl -fsSL &#x27;https://github.com/school/marea/releases/download/v0.1.0-preview.1/install.sh&#x27; | sh -s -- student --server &#x27;https://school.test&#x27;</textarea></label><label>Windows PowerShell<textarea readOnly="" rows="3">&amp; ([scriptblock]::Create((Invoke-RestMethod &#x27;https://github.com/school/marea/releases/download/v0.1.0-preview.1/install.ps1&#x27;))) -Component student -Server &#x27;https://school.test&#x27;</textarea></label></aside>"`;

